cuna nishanno cay pachachöpis rurananpaj?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"¿Pucutaycunata mandanquimanchu","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"gamman tamyachimunanpaj?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Räyu mayninmanpis chayananpaj niptiqui ¿gamta wiyashunquichu","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‹Caychömi caycä gam nimashayquita ruranäpaj› nir?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":36,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"¿Pitaj äbicunata yachayta gosha timpu imano cashantapis musyananpaj?","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"¿Pitaj yachayta gosha pacha waränanpäna gällu tantiyananpaj?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":37,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"¿Pitaj sumaj yachaj caycan ayca pucutay cashantapis musyananpaj?","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"¿Pitaj syëlucho caycaj ishtanquicunata cacharaycamunman tamyamunanpaj,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":38,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"chaynöpana ñuchu allpa mituman ticracurir","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"curpacunaman ruracänanpaj?","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":39,"content":[{"text":"«¿Gamchu aychata ashinqui maman liyuncunapaj?","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"¿Liyuncuna yargaycaj","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":40,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"pacacunancho jitarpaycajta,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"shatacunacho llupurpaycajta sacsachinquichuraj?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":41,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"¿Pitaj micuyta tarichin cuervo äbicunapa","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"wawancuna micuyta ashir purishan öra,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"fiyupa yargaypita gaparpashpan mañacamashan öra?","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/qub_wbt/JOB/38.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/qub_wbt/JOB/39.json","nextChapterAudioLi